<title>CANADA: FIGURE SKATING-CHAMPIONS SERIES FINAL ENTRY LIST.</title>
<headline>FIGURE SKATING-CHAMPIONS SERIES FINAL ENTRY LIST.</headline>
<dateline>HAMILTON, Ontario 1997-02-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>List of qualifiers</p>
<p>for the Champions Series Final figure skating competition,</p>
<p>which begins on Friday (points accumulated during six-meet</p>
<p>series in brackets, previous points have no bearing on Final):</p>
<p>Women's singles</p>
<p>Michelle Kwan, U.S. (24)</p>
<p>Irina Slutskaya, Russia (24)</p>
<p>Maria Butyrskaya, Russia (21)</p>
<p>Tonia Kwiatkowski, U.S. (18)</p>
<p>Tara Lipinski, U.S. (16)</p>
<p>Olga Markova, Russia (14)</p>
<p>Men's singles</p>
<p>Todd Eldredge, U.S. (24)</p>
<p>Alexei Urmanov, Russia (24)</p>
<p>Elvis Stojko, Canada (24)</p>
<p>Ilia Kulik, Russia (18)</p>
<p>Alexei Yagudin, Russia (16)</p>
<p>Dimitry Dmitrenko, Ukraine (16)</p>
<p>Pairs</p>
<p>Mandy Wotzel/Ingo Steuer, Germany (24)</p>
<p>Jenni Meno/Todd Sand, U.S. (21)</p>
<p>Oksana Kazakova/Artur Dmitriev, Russia (19)</p>
<p>Marina Eltsova/Andrei Bushkov, Russia (18)</p>
<p>Ice Dancing</p>
<p>Anjelika Krylova/Oleg Ovsiannikov, Russia (24)</p>
<p>Marina Anissina/Gwendal Peizerat, France (21)</p>
<p>Shae-Lynn Bourne/Victor Kraatz, Canada (21)</p>
<p>Irina Lobacheva/Ilia Averbukh, Russia (18)</p>
<p>Irina Romanova/Igor Yarashenko, Ukraine (14)</p>
